  "name": "Fresh Mild Salsa",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This fresh, mild salsa recipe, made with tomatoes, garlic, bell peppers, cumin, serrano chiles, and jalape\u00f1os, can be tweaked for more or less heat.",
